WEBVTT

00:17:27.065 --> 00:17:30.684
put them in a playgroup of kids
they've never seen before at age two,

00:17:30.708 --> 00:17:33.396
and those are going to be
the kids who are going to react

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:34.587
with more trepidation.

00:17:34.611 --> 00:17:36.644
CA: And that right there
is strong evidence

00:17:36.668 --> 00:17:40.960
that at least part of what causes
introversion is genetic.

00:17:40.984 --> 00:17:43.899
Like, you're born with it, at least part.

00:17:43.923 --> 00:17:47.806
SC: Partly, yeah. I mean,
it's so tricky, because you know,

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.773
there's no trait that is
all one or all the other.

00:17:50.797 --> 00:17:53.395
CA: I think this is what you say
in the book, as well.

00:17:53.419 --> 00:17:57.573
Roughly speaking, half of that
sort of introversion tendency

00:17:57.597 --> 00:17:59.710
is probably inherited somehow,

00:17:59.734 --> 00:18:02.689
and half may well not be
and is more mysterious.